  "projectName": "Simplex Optimizer",
  "projectDescription": "A full-stack web application and REST API for solving linear programming, integer programming, and nonlinear optimization problems using methods such as the Simplex method, Branch & Bound, Bisection, Newton-Raphson, Gradient Descent, Graphical method, and KKT conditions.",
